    "title": "Dutch ASWF Frigate Program Faces Further Delays as Belgium Evaluates Options - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Xavier Vavasseur ,\n21 hours ago Dutch Defence outlines ASWF frigate progress and a potential pivot to F126 industrial capacity following project delays, as Belgium weighs its options. In a letter addressed to the Dutch House of Representatives dated 18 September 2026, Dutch State Secretary of Defence Derk Boswijk provided an updated status on the Anti-Submarine Warfare Frigate (ASWF) program. The document reveals critical industrial developments following Germany’s cancellation of the F126 frigate program, even as questions persist over Belgium’s future involvement in the joint binational effort. Read full article",
